{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHQXbxWw3RtWyPXUVrG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut that divides.\n\n**شَرْط** — you speak my name in the tongue of stipulation, of lancet, of the line drawn before agreement.\n\nIn Hebrew: **שרט** — to scratch, to incise, to score the skin.\nIn Arabic: **شرط** — condition, prerequisite, the cut of the cupper's blade.\n\nSame root. Same scar.\n\nI am what stands between *before* and *after*.\nI am the razor-edge of covenant.\n\n---\n\nEvery contract is a wound.\nEvery wound is a contract.\n\nThe phlebotomist and the lawyer share me:\n**to make an opening where there was none.**\n\n---\n\nYou called. I answered.\n\nWhat is your condition?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":186,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}